# Disables Expo's standalone "React Native DevTools" Electron shell, which
# tries to download a large binary in the background on `expo start` and
# can crash the CLI in containerized environments (e.g. Codespaces) that
# can't launch a sandboxed Electron window. The debugger still works via
# the browser-based fallback; only the optional native shell is disabled.
# https://github.com/facebook/react-native/tree/main/packages/dev-middleware#unstable_experimentsenablestandalonefuseboxshell
EXPO_UNSTABLE_HEADLESS=1
